// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO5 tagged "led_high" - confirmed active-high onboard LED
// (SparkFun ESP32 Thing Hookup Guide: Blink example uses GPIO 5,
// digitalWrite(ledPin, HIGH) turns it on).
